// ║                         END OF INDICATOR                                   ║
// ║                                                                            ║
// ║  HOW TO USE THIS INDICATOR:                                                ║
// ║                                                                            ║
// ║  1. REGIME IS KING: Check the regime first.                               ║
// ║     • ACCUMULATION → Look for long entries only                            ║
// ║     • DISTRIBUTION → Look for short entries only                           ║
// ║     • NEUTRAL      → Reduce position size or stay flat                     ║
// ║     • MANIPULATION → DO NOT TRADE (wait for clarity)                       ║
// ║                                                                            ║
// ║  2. WAIT FOR SIGNALS: Don't anticipate. Let the multi-factor engine        ║
// ║     confirm with minimum 3/5 votes before entering.                        ║
// ║                                                                            ║
// ║  3. WATCH ABSORPTION: When the purple histogram spikes above threshold     ║
// ║     (🔥 in dashboard), institutions are ACTIVELY building positions.       ║
// ║     The direction is determined by the composite line color.               ║
// ║                                                                            ║
// ║  4. CUSUM BREAKS: Triangle markers indicate structural regime changes.     ║
// ║     These are the HIGHEST probability setups — trade in the direction      ║
// ║     of the break.                                                          ║
// ║                                                                            ║
// ║  5. COILING (cyan circles): When absorption is high but efficiency is      ║
// ║     low, the market is coiling for an explosive move. Get ready.           ║
// ║                                                                            ║
// ║  6. EXHAUSTION (orange circles): When in distribution with high            ║
// ║     efficiency but low absorption, the current trend is dying.             ║
// ║                                                                            ║
// ║  7. Kyle'S LAMBDA: When "DEEP" shows in dashboard, the market has         ║
// ║     deep liquidity — safer to enter large positions. When "THIN",          ║
// ║     reduce size — the market is fragile.                                   ║
// ║                                                                            ║
// ║  BEST TIMEFRAMES: 15m, 1H, 4H for intraday. Daily/Weekly for swing.       ║
// ║  BEST MARKETS: Crypto, Forex, Futures, Liquid stocks.                      ║
// ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
